<span>1</span>
<h3>Choose the measure</h3>
<p>Calculated cost, actual grant excluding SWEPT, or grant including SWEPT. Do not switch mid-trend.</p>
</article>
<article>
<span>2</span>
<h3>Match the students</h3>
<p>If charter or EFA dollars are included, include their enrollment too.</p>
</article>
<article>
