<section class="bottom-line">
<div class="shell bottom-grid">
<div>
<p class="eyebrow">Bottom line</p>
<h2>The direction is real. The size of the claimed jump is not.</h2>
</div>
<p>Nominal funding increased and district enrollment declined. But the post blends cost estimates, actual grants, and SWEPT-inclusive totals. A fair comparison must use one definition and matching enrollment every year.</p>
</div>
