<footer>
<div class="shell footer-grid">
<div>
<strong>Method</strong>
<p>Nominal statewide dollars. EFA figures use scheduled payments. Charter SPED sent to districts is counted once and shown separately.</p>
</div>
<div>
<strong>Limitations</strong>
<p>The legislator has not supplied a calculation workbook. Our reconstruction identifies the closest results in the available state files and labels uncertainty.</p>
</div>
